// Vendored from zellij 0.44.3's built-in `tokyo-night-light`, only
// `text_selected` changed: upstream's 1.12:1 against ghostty's Day background is
// near-invisible, so these are ghostty's own selection colours. Must live in the
// theme dir (built-ins override config.kdl `themes {}`), and Themes::merge
// replaces whole entries, so untouched components are copied verbatim.
// Re-vendor from zellij-utils/assets/themes/tokyo-night-light.kdl on a zellij bump.
themes {
    tokyo-night-light {
        text_unselected {
